# Windows PowerShell 5.1 reads .ps1 without a BOM using the system ANSI
# codepage, which turns the Chinese text in these scripts into mojibake - and
# Big5 trail bytes include { } ' " \, so the file stops parsing. It also fails
# to terminate here-strings when the line endings are LF-only.
#
# These files are therefore stored as UTF-8-with-BOM + CRLF, and marked -text so
# git never normalises them on checkout or when GitHub builds a ZIP.
*.ps1 -text
*.bat -text
